  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.07 Bulk plant or terminal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.07 “Bulk plant or terminal” means that portion of a property where petroleum products or hazardous waste liquids are received by tank vessel, pipeline, tank car, or tank vehicle and are stored or blended in bulk for the purpose of distributing such liquids by tank vessel, pipeline, tank car, tank vehicle, portable tank, or container.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.07); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.09)",
